# Throwaway offline-validation scripts / renders (not part of the game)
scratchpad/

# Godot's import CACHE is machine-local and rebuilt on open.
.godot/

# NOTE: *.import files are deliberately NOT ignored. They are Godot 4 import
# metadata (importer settings + the uid and cache path each asset resolves to),
# they contain no machine-specific paths, and they are meant to be committed.
# Ignoring them lets every machine invent its own mapping, which is how every
# .wav ended up resolving to a single 0.18s sample on one checkout.
